	Fork flavor resource overrides.

	Source set priority is buildType > flavor > main, so anything redefined here silently replaces
	app/src/main/res/ without editing it. This file is the demonstration and the place to rename the
	app; add colors.xml, themes.xml, drawables and so on alongside it the same way.
-->
<resources xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools">
